# Keep the build context small; npm ci reinstalls, next build rebuilds.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/out
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
.git
.github
docs
# Root-level docs only; packages/content/**/*.mdx is app content and stays.
/README.md
/LICENSE

# Never ship local env files into the image (secrets live in 1Password).
**/.env*.local
**/.env.development
**/.env.test
.DS_Store
